1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:39,364
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 20=

3
00:00:39,799 --> 00:00:41,500
I'll protect you
for the rest of my life.

4
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:43,920
Will you marry me?

5
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,900
I can't give you an answer yet.

6
00:01:46,859 --> 00:01:48,180
Not because I don't want to.

7
00:01:49,019 --> 00:01:50,299
It's just not time yet.

8
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,739
I want you

9
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:55,579
to see more of the world,

10
00:01:56,219 --> 00:01:57,659
meet more people,

11
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:00,260
and experience more of life.

12
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,760
Then come back and decide

13
00:02:02,859 --> 00:02:04,459
if you still want to make that promise.

14
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,580
If, by then,

15
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,400
you still choose me,

16
00:02:13,539 --> 00:02:14,719
we'll get married.

17
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:20,860
Okay.

18
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:25,800
Keep this for me until then.

19
00:03:07,460 --> 00:03:08,219
Dr. Pei.

20
00:03:08,379 --> 00:03:11,300
The fourth pig's anastomosis

21
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,960
started leaking during reperfusion.

22
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:14,900
We repaired it,

23
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:16,560
but I'm not sure it'll hold.

24
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:20,240
The suture spacing was too wide.

25
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,080
Next time, take smaller bites,

26
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,300
close together,

27
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:26,439
and check the tension before you close.

28
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:29,879
I followed the same protocol
as the first three.

29
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:30,919
No, no.

30
00:03:31,659 --> 00:03:33,479
Every animal is different.

31
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,199
Adjust accordingly.

32
00:03:35,419 --> 00:03:38,240
I'll review the footage with you
tomorrow morning.

33
00:03:38,919 --> 00:03:39,500
Okay.

34
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:40,379
Okay.

35
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,379
Thank you.

36
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:01,840
Come in.

37
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:05,419
Ms. Wen.

38
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,400
The monthly report

39
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,060
for the Yuguang Legal Aid Center

40
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,139
is out.

41
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,680
Our network has grown

42
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,120
to 12 partner law firms.

43
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,740
Total cases accepted to date

44
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:17,399
are up almost 40% from last month.

45
00:04:17,779 --> 00:04:19,300
The legal aid hotline is open too.

46
00:04:19,339 --> 00:04:20,259
We have lots of calls.

47
00:04:22,259 --> 00:04:22,740
Good.

48
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:24,399
Let's set a time next week

49
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:27,040
to meet with the heads
of the partner firms

50
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:29,420
and discuss how to expand our reach.

51
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,920
As for your divorce cases,

52
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,339
Ms. Zhang signed
the settlement agreement today.

53
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,980
Its custody and asset division terms

54
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:38,319
both meet our goals.

55
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,519
Ms. Li's case goes to trial next week.

56
00:04:40,779 --> 00:04:42,240
We've organized all the evidence.

57
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,100
Our chances are good.

58
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,259
Wonderful.

59
00:04:48,939 --> 00:04:49,800
All good news.

60
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,079
Ms. Wen.

61
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,819
Dr. Pei hasn't been around lately.

62
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:58,040
Has he been busy?

63
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:01,279
He's fine.

64
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,000
You go ahead.

65
00:05:04,699 --> 00:05:05,720
I'll get going, then.

66
00:06:24,607 --> 00:06:25,420
(Pei Yiqiu)

67
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:26,800
(How have you been?)

68
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,093
(Wanqing)

69
00:06:39,093 --> 00:06:40,060
(Keep going!)

70
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,900
(Suggested photo to send:)

71
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,480
(When I first got here,)

72
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:52,819
(I asked myself every day)

73
00:06:53,379 --> 00:06:54,500
(why I'd come.)

74
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:57,899
(In time, I came to understand)

75
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:01,000
(that some paths must be walked alone.)

76
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:03,459
(And you?)

77
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,800
(How have you been?)

78
00:07:08,339 --> 00:07:09,540
(I'm doing well.)

79
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,000
(Life is busy,)

80
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,860
(but fulfilling.)

81
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,000
(And you?)

82
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:18,339
(How have you been?)

83
00:07:41,315 --> 00:07:43,020
(5th Floor, Building 1)

84
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:45,019
Wait.

85
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,060
Try this.

86
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,600
I haven't swallowed yet.

87
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,500
Sweet?

88
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,379
It's so sour!

89
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,439
I'm done.

90
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,000
It's not sour.

91
00:08:04,459 --> 00:08:05,500
You tricked me!

92
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,646
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
